From 8445323b11ab01ec9e43b4d961264577d38cc05e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hades <15710513+hadesdevls@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 21:58:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] skin.estuary: the step-down level of frames with GUI elements
 in the overview

The overview of the player information gives the fidelity step-down
level of native Dolby Vision frames: the level of the frames without GUI
elements of the format (hades.dv.step). Where the frames with GUI
elements over the picture are drawn at another one (CDVGuiStep), and the
overview is such a GUI element itself, the window system publishes that
one too (hades.dv.guistep), and the row says both, with a middle dot
between them: "level 0" and "2 with GUI". Measured with the font of the
row (Noto Sans at 25), its widest form takes 217 of its 340 pixels in
en_gb and 255 in es_es.
---
 .../language/resource.language.en_gb/strings.po           | 6 ++++++
 .../language/resource.language.es_ar/strings.po           | 6 ++++++
 .../language/resource.language.es_es/strings.po           | 6 ++++++
 .../language/resource.language.es_mx/strings.po           | 6 ++++++
 addons/skin.estuary/xml/Variables.xml                     | 5 ++++-
 xbmc/windowing/gbm/WinSystemGbmGLESContext.cpp            | 8 +++++---
 6 files changed, 33 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/addons/skin.estuary/language/resource.language.en_gb/strings.po b/addons/skin.estuary/language/resource.language.en_gb/strings.po
index d2d027e..1d62a2d 100644
--- a/addons/skin.estuary/language/resource.language.en_gb/strings.po
+++ b/addons/skin.estuary/language/resource.language.en_gb/strings.po
@@ -1736,6 +1736,12 @@ msgctxt "#31787"
 msgid "BT.2390 (ITU-R)"
 msgstr ""
 
+#: /xml/Variables.xml
+#. Fidelity step-down row of the overview of the player information, after the level of the frames without GUI elements: the level that the frames with GUI elements over the picture are drawn at where they cannot keep up at that one (shown while GUI elements are over the picture), as in "level 0 · 2 with GUI"
+msgctxt "#31788"
+msgid "with GUI"
+msgstr ""
+
 #: /xml/DialogPlayerProcessInfo.xml
 #. Name of the overview page of the player information
 msgctxt "#31800"
