+#: /xml/Variables.xml
+#. Fidelity step-down row of the overview of the player information, after the level of the frames without GUI elements: the level that the frames with GUI elements over the picture are drawn at where they cannot keep up at that one (shown while GUI elements are over the picture), as in "level 0 · 2 with GUI"
